## Example 2: Reduction Operation (Summation)

Reduction operations (like summing all elements) are more complex than element-wise operations because they require synchronization and hierarchical reduction (threads $\rightarrow$ blocks $\rightarrow$ grid). RAJA provides specific constructs for this.

### 1. Original CUDA Code (Reduction)

```cpp
